# Not applied to vendor/ (no private forks). Apply upstream with: git apply reports/template_fix_validate_footprint.patch
# Effect on the GEMSDOE77 files: primary (zeros) and twin (NaN) both PASS; a band-1-footprint file with NaN on the 3,061 official cells FAILS.
